23
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:28,964
I go to air shows and
pretty familiar with aircraft.

24
00:01:28,964 --> 00:01:30,465
It was unbelievable.

25
00:01:30,465 --> 00:01:33,093
It left us all in shock,

26
00:01:33,093 --> 00:01:37,306
